          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content4\" group=\"Content\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video'&&bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"11\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1-1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"title col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>How Does Quietum Plus Works?</b></h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><div>Paragraph 1: Core Identity and Purpose</div><div>Gelagen represents a premium, doctor-formulated beauty supplement that addresses cellular skin decay, hair thinning, and nail brittleness. It is crafted using advanced Korean nutricosmetic principles, designed specifically for individuals who want a simple, highly absorbent alternative to hard-to-swallow pills or messy powder drinks. Delivered as daily raspberry-flavored chewable gummies, Gelagen supplies systemic nourishment that supports collagen production, promotes rapid cell turnover, and protects body tissues against the continuous onslaught of daily environmental stressors.</div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\">Paragraph 2: Comprehensive Nutritional Matrix</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\">At its core, Gelagen contains a balanced blend of essential vitamins, minerals, and botanical cofactors designed to restore natural radiance. Every single bottle provides a carefully measured blend featuring a high dose of Biotin, Vitamin C, Vitamin A, B-complex nutrients, Folate, and essential trace minerals like Zinc. By delivering these nutrients in high bioavailability forms, Gelagen helps repair cellular structures damaged by aging, sun exposure, and toxic air pollution. This holistic approach ensures every body organ, particularly skin tissue, receives the key cofactors necessary for continuous regeneration</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\">Designed for seamless integration into busy lifestyles, Valiora eliminates the need for messy mixing powders, strict meal timings, or complicated multi-step dosage plans. It provides a clean, straightforward wellness option for adults who want to stay on track with their weight and fitness goals without disrupting their daily routines.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></div><br><div><span style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\">Paragraph 3: Advanced Delivery System</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\">The chewable pectin-based delivery system gives Gelagen a massive advantage over standard capsulated vitamin supplements. The moment a gummy is chewed, initial enzyme activity begins breaking down the nutrients in the mouth, facilitating faster, direct absorption into the vascular system. Pectin is plant-derived and vegetarian-friendly, meaning it bypasses the digestive heaviness and gastrointestinal irritation often associated with gelatin-based gummies. This superior bioavailability ensures maximum utilization of every milligram of active ingredient, avoiding unnecessary waste and driving faster, visible skin, hair, and nail improvements&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></div><br><div><span style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\">Paragraph 4: Safety, Quality, and Manufacturing</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\">Gelagen is manufactured inside state-of-the-art, FDA-registered facilities located in the United States that strictly adhere to current Good Manufacturing Practices (cGMP). The formula is non-GMO, naturally gluten-free, dairy-free, and free of artificial chemical dyes or harsh synthetic fillers. Natural colorings from red beet root extract give the product its appetizing hue, guaranteeing a clean and pure wellness routine. Independent lab testing guarantees batch purity, label accuracy, and complete safety, providing consumers with absolute peace of mind during long-term daily supplementation routines.</span></div></h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
