          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content4\" group=\"Content\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video'&&bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"11\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1-1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"title col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>How Does Quietum Plus Works?</b></h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><div>Paragraph 1: Rebuilding Cellular Structure</div><div>Gelagen functions through a multi-stage mechanism that begins by repairing the dermal structural framework. As people age, natural collagen production drops significantly, causing fine lines, skin sagging, and weakened tissue density. Gelagen supplies vital collagen-synthesizing cofactors, such as high-potency Vitamin C and Biotin, which stimulate the body’s internal fibroblasts. This cellular trigger accelerates the natural creation of sturdy collagen and elastin fibers, restoring firmness, density, and youthful elasticity across the skin, while simultaneously building up hair shaft resilience and nail strength.</div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\">Paragraph 2: Enhancing Hydration and Barrier Function</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\">Beyond collagen synthesis, Gelagen works extensively to optimize internal tissue hydration and barrier defense. Pantothenic acid and lipid-soluble Vitamin E reinforce the lipid matrix of the epidermal layer, locking in intercellular moisture and preventing transepidermal water loss. This barrier-strengthening mechanism leaves skin feeling plump, smooth, and visibly dewy throughout the day. It also stops dry, flakey scalps from compromising follicle growth and prevents brittleness from causing vertical nail ridges, promoting deeply hydrated skin and flexible hair and nails.</span></div><br><div><span style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\">Paragraph 3: Accelerating Tissue Turnover</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\">Another critical pathway of Gelagen is the active acceleration of healthy cellular turnover. With aging, old, dead skin cells linger on the surface longer, resulting in a dull, uneven tone and clogged pores. Gelagen introduces bio-available Folate (Vitamin B9) and Vitamin B12, which play pivotal roles in nucleic acid synthesis and healthy cell division. This continuous influx of B-vitamins accelerates the shedding of damaged surface cells, allowing fresh, bright, and evenly pigmented new skin layers to emerge while revitalizing idle hair follicles</span></div><br><div><span style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\">&nbsp;</span><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\">Paragraph 4: Neutralizing Environmental Oxidative Stress</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 22.4px;\">Gelagen offers a broad spectrum of antioxidant defenses that protect delicate cellular DNA from oxidative damage. Ultraviolet rays, environmental smog, stress, and poor diet generate destructive free radicals that break down skin proteins and trigger premature aging. The synergistic antioxidant powerhouse contained in Gelagen—comprising Vitamin A, Vitamin C, Vitamin E, and Zinc—actively intercepts and neutralizes these unstable free radicals. This biological defense shield preserves newly synthesized collagen strands, prevents discoloration, and protects hair roots against age-related stress.</span></div></h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
