        {
          "_name": "people3",
          "_sourceTheme": "formulam5",
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "& when (@bg-type = \"color\")": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = \"image\")": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            "img": {
              "width": "120px",
              "height": "120px",
              "object-fit": "cover",
              "border-radius": "50% !important",
              "margin": "auto",
              "margin-bottom": "1.5rem"
            },
            ".mbr-iconfont": {
              "margin": "auto",
              "display": "inline-flex",
              "font-size": "1.5rem",
              "color": "@iconColor",
              "width": "30px",
              "justify-content": "center",
              "align-items": "center"
            },
            ".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper": {
              "color": "#232323"
            },
            ".card-text": {
              "color": "#d0021b"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#4e423d"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "color": "#232323"
            },
            ".content-head": {
              "max-width": "800px"
            },
            ".card-subtitle": {
              "color": "#a1a1a1"
            }
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"formulam5 people3\" group=\"People\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n    <select title=\"Columns\" name=\"cardsWidth\">\n      <option value=\"6\">2</option>\n      <option value=\"4\" selected>3</option>\n      <option value=\"3\">4</option>\n    </select>\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n\n    <header>Card</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Name\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Status\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Stars\" name=\"showStars\" checked>\n\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Icon Color\" name=\"iconColor\" value=\"#ca9236\" selected>\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value parallax>\n      <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n      <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n    </fieldset>\n    <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n    <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n\n  <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n  <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\"></div>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row mb-5 justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 content-head\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-9': cardsAmount == '3'}\">\n        <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n          <b>Testimonials</b>\n        </h3>\n        <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n          Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet nulla vel, consectetur massa adipiscing.\n        </h5>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}} mb-3\">\n        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"card-box align-center\">\n            <div class=\"iconfont-wrapper mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showStars\">\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-to-local-drive mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n            </div>\n            <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper\">The reason I stuck with this one is honestly the taste. I have bought powders twice and abandoned both by week three because mixing something at 6:40 in the morning was never going to happen in my house. These sit next to the coffee and I chew two while the kettle boils.\n<div>\n</div><div>Nine weeks in, my hair is not longer, but I am pulling much less out of the shower drain and it holds a blow dry better than it did. I take that as breakage rather than growth, which is what this page said to expect, so fine.</div></h4>\n            <a href=\"https://mwebsignalhq.com/13570/1970/2/?\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/member-1.webp\" alt=\"Meera S.\" title></a>\n\n            <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style mb-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\"><b>Meera S.</b><br></p>\n\n            <h5 class=\"card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-subtitle\">\n              Client</h5>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}} mb-3\">\n        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"card-box align-center\">\n            <div class=\"iconfont-wrapper mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showStars\">\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-cart-add mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n            </div>\n            <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper\"><div>Six weeks and I cannot tell you anything has changed on my face. My nails are a little better and that is all I would swear to. I am leaving three stars because I want to be fair rather than enthusiastic.\n</div><div>What I will say is that customer service answered my email about the guarantee in one day and did not try to talk me out of anything, which is more than I expected. I am going to finish the second bottle before I decide.</div><div>\n</div></h4>\n            <a href=\"https://mwebsignalhq.com/13570/1970/2/?\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/member-2.webp\" alt=\"Karen B.\" title data-slide-to=\"1\" data-bs-slide-to=\"2\"></a>\n\n            <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style mb-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\"><b>Karen B.</b><br></p>\n\n            <h5 class=\"card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-subtitle\">\n              Client</h5>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}} mb-3\">\n        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"card-box align-center\">\n            <div class=\"iconfont-wrapper mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showStars\">\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n            </div>\n            <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper\">and I was tired of filing them down to nothing. Nothing happened for a month and I nearly gave up. Around week seven the new growth coming in was noticeably less bendy, and by week fourteen I have grown them out for the first time in years.\n<div>\n</div><div>My skin is the harder one to judge because I changed nothing else and I do not photograph myself. What I can say is that the tight feeling I used to get after washing my face in winter is not there this year.</div></h4>\n            <a href=\"https://mwebsignalhq.com/13570/1970/2/?\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/member-3.webp\" alt=\"Priya D.\" title data-slide-to=\"2\" data-bs-slide-to=\"1\"></a>\n\n            <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style mb-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\"><b>Priya D.</b><br></p>\n\n            <h5 class=\"card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-subtitle\">\n              Client</h5>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n\n\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row mt-0 mt-md-5\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\">\n        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\">\n          <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Read More</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
